  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Navbar Components**\n\nI\'m now building out the Navbar components. I\'ve started with `src/components/Navbar.tsx`, meticulously adhering to the 3-zone contract. Zone 1 features the wordmark \"PENCIL\" and \"STR\", styled precisely as specified. Zone 2 encompasses the four essential navigation links. I\'m focusing on ensuring pixel-perfect style execution.\n\n\n**Defining Hero Layouts**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `ScannerHero` component, aiming for pixel-perfect replication of the design. The badge, headline with the specified typeface, and subtitle are taking shape. I\'m focusing on the rounded pill URL input with the search icon and \"PENCIL DEAL\" button, complete with loading state. I am also working on the benchmarks.\n\n\n**Analyzing Underwriter Studio**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the design of the `UnderwriterStudio.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on the cohort status bar: `LIVE SCAN COHORT: SMOKY MTNS \302\267 MLS #248190`, latency, elevation. I\'m carefully reviewing the two-card layout, the left card including the 12-month seasonality chart and monthly revenue tooltip on hover. The right card\'s financing strategy controls and interactive sliders are the current focus. I\'m making sure it includes the `DOWNLOAD LENDER MEMO (PDF) \342\206\222` button.\n\n\n**Calculating Financial Returns**\n\nI\'m now calculating the returns. I have broken down the Net Operating Income, Annual Debt Service, and Levered Cash Flow to determine Cash-on-Cash Return, Cap Rate, and DSCR. The Visual Capital Stack progress bar is coming together, too. The interactive Sensitivity Matrix is also a key component. I am now working on the 5-Year Equity & Return Forecast. I\'ll need to figure out what I will do for action buttons.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Modules**\n\nI\'m now focusing on three feature modules within `FeatureModules.tsx`. I am working on the architecture and cognition, specifically the Precision Underwriting Stack section. The goal is to build Autonomous Market Sweeps, DSCR & Creative Financing modules, and 100-Page HOA & Zoning Scans. Each will include a concise preview. I also started building the Case Studies and Pricing Section. I am currently working on the structure.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 9
      nanos: 553131172
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "s3e5auzhMLrpqtsP972ouQw"
  }
}
