  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Underwriter Studio**\n\nI\'m focusing now on building a short-term rental underwriting workbench, specifically `src/components/UnderwriterStudio.tsx`. It will provide an institutional-grade experience. The key features will include an active property selector, and the option for a custom deal, allowing for flexibility in how a property is considered.\n\n\n**Refining Feature Scope**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down on the sensitivity controls and the pro-forma income statement features for the underwriter workbench. The goal is a truly interactive experience. I\'m focusing on user control over the financing model, adding a matrix to show sensitivity ranges, and ensuring the key metrics are clearly displayed. The income & expense ledger should update live.\n\n\n"
