  planner_response {
    response: "I have built **PencilSTR \342\200\224 Autonomous STR Underwriting & DSCR Engine**, matching your visual specifications, design tokens, and screenshot layout, while providing deep, interactive functionality across all tabs and devices:\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n1. **Live Deal Scanner & Hero Underwriting Terminal**\n   - **Editorial Typography & Search**: Styled with Plus Jakarta Sans and Playfair Display serif, featuring a functional URL/MLS listing ingestion bar with live animation and quick benchmarks (*Timberline Cabin*, *Desert Villa*, *Broken Bow*, *Blue Ridge*).\n   - **Interactive Live Underwriting Terminal**:\n     - **Visual Property Card & Price Drop Alerts**: High-resolution architectural photography with turnkey indicators and elevation metadata.\n     - **12-Month Projected Seasonality Bar Chart**: Monthly revenue distribution with interactive hover tooltips (showing exact revenue, occupancy, and ADR) and peak season tags (*October Leaf Run*).\n     - **Financing Strategy Selector**: Instantly switch between **DSCR 1.34x**, **Conventional**, and **Seller Carry** debt structures.\n     - **Real-Time Interactive Scrubbers**: Average Daily Rate (ADR) and Stabilized Occupancy sliders that recalculate Cash-on-Cash Return, Levered Monthly Flow, and Cap Rate on the fly.\n     - **HOA CC&R Validation Banner**: Highlights unrestricted \302\2474.1 status and parking thresholds.\n\n2. **Dedicated Underwriter Studio**\n   - **Complete Pro Forma Ledger (Year 1)**: Itemized financial breakdown covering Gross Rental Revenue, Cleaning turnover, OTA fees (3%), Management fees (0\342\200\22325%), Property Taxes, Insurance, Utilities, and CapEx reserves.\n   - **Capital Stack Visualization**: Visual distribution of Loan Principal, Down Payment, and Cash Reserves with customized loan terms.\n   - **Dynamic Sensitivity Matrix**: Stress-test grid cross-referencing ADR shifts ($\\pm 15\\%$) against occupancy drops with real-time CoC% and DSCR ratios.\n\n3. **HOA CC&R & Zoning AI Audit Engine**\n   - **Deed Restriction Analysis**: Deep-dive clause inspection for 0-Night Minimum Stays, County Permits, Quiet Hours, and Parking limits.\n   - **Custom CC&R Ingestion**: Input custom deed or covenant text to run simulated legal parsing.\n   - **Purchase Contract Contingency Generator**: 1-click copyable legal addendum clause to protect earnest money deposits during due diligence.\n\n4. **Institutional Credit Memorandum Modal & PDF Export**\n   - Comprehensive committee-ready memorandum with Sources & Uses, Pro Forma statement, debt metrics, and print-ready stylesheet (`window.print()` / PDF export).\n\n5. **Pricing Architecture & Saved Pipeline**\n   - **Tier Selector**: Scout ($29), Operator ($79, Most Popular), and Desk/Fund ($199) with Monthly/Annual (-20%) toggle and an interactive 14-day trial activation modal.\n   - **Feature Comparison Matrix & Saved Pipeline Drawer**: Bookmark deals from anywhere in the app to compare cohorts side by side."
    thinking: "**Reviewing Our Progress**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` both completed successfully, error-free! Now, I\'m meticulously comparing our implementation against every requirement detailed in the user prompt and the `frontend-design` constitution to make sure we\'re on the right track, especially concerning the visual aspects of the screens.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Interface**\n\nI\'m now integrating HTML image hotlinks for a visually rich base that\'s user-friendly across all devices. I am also working to build out all features and a stunning dashboard, adhering to the screen designs. I have begun work to ensure precision with the specified editorial headline, color scheme, and terminal status bar, all designed for the underwriting terminal. The visual elements are becoming a cohesive experience.\n\n\n"
