ratios.\n\n3. **HOA CC&R & Zoning AI Audit Engine**\n   - **Deed Restriction Analysis**: Deep-dive clause inspection for 0-Night Minimum Stays, County Permits, Quiet Hours, and Parking limits.\n   - **Custom CC&R Ingestion**: Input custom deed or covenant text to run simulated legal parsing.\n   - **Purchase Contract Contingency Generator**: 1-click copyable legal addendum clause to protect earnest money deposits during due diligence.\n\n4. **Institutional Credit Memorandum Modal & PDF Export**\n   - Comprehensive committee-ready memorandum with Sources & Uses, Pro Forma statement, debt metrics, and print-ready stylesheet (`window.print()` / PDF export).\n\n5. **Pricing Architecture & Saved Pipeline**\n   - **Tier Selector**: Scout ($29), Operator ($79, Most Popular), and Desk/Fund ($199) with Monthly/Annual (-20%) toggle and an interactive 14-day trial activation modal.\n   - **Feature Comparison Matrix & Saved Pipeline Drawer**: Bookmark deals from anywhere in the app to compare cohorts side by side."
