  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Saga Modules**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the Beowulf saga modules. I\'ve started defining the structure, including the initial module: \"The Theft of the Flagon\" which will incorporate elements such as a background thrall intrusion, a 300-year-old hoard breach, and a live alarm feed. I\'ve also outlined the second module, \"Comitatus & Thane Desert.\"\n\n\n**Analyzing Saga Modules**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing the capital stack breakdown for the war-band and outlining Module 03, \"The Biting of N\303\246gling & The Fatal Venom,\" which delves into the blade\'s failure and the dragon\'s venom. I am also working on two case studies focusing on the Slaying at Earnaness and the Great Pyre at Hronesness. Also, I am outlining the three epic roles/oaths, including the Runaway Thrall and Wiglaf the Successor, for `src/components/BeowulfTiers.tsx`. I am also working on creating the modal displaying Beowulf\'s last words.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_275140"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { BEOWULF_PART_3, COWARD_THANES_LOG } from \'../data/beowulfData\';\\n\\ninterface BeowulfModulesProps {\\n  onOpenVerseModal: (line: number) => void;\\n  onOpenTestament: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const BeowulfModules: React.FC<BeowulfModulesProps> = ({\\n  onOpenVerseModal,\\n  onOpenTestament,\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <section className=\\\"max-w-[1360px] w-full mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-12\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl mb-12\\\">\\n        <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#92400E] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-2\\\">\\n          CODEX ANALYSIS // ARCHIVAL RIGOR\\n        </span>\\n        <h2 className=\\\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#111110] tracking-tight mb-3\\\">\\n          The Anatomy of the Dragon\'s Bane.\\n        </h2>\\n        <p className=\\\"text-sm md:text-base text-[#666562] leading-relaxed font-sans\\\">\\n          Deconstructed lines from the Cotton Vitellius manuscript exploring the ancient curse, the comitatus bond, and the fatal venom.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\">\\n        {/* Module 01: The Theft of the Flagon */}\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#E5E4DF] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#111110]/30 transition-all\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#FEF3C7] text-[#92400E] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">local_bar</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#92400E] tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n                MODULE 01\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold font-sans text-[#111110] mb-1.5\\\">\\n              The Theft of the Golden Flagon\\n            </h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#666562] leading-relaxed mb-4\\\">\\n              An unnamed thrall, escaping his master\'s harsh wrath, stumbles into the subterranean mound and seizes a jeweled beaker from under the dragon\'s coiled flank.\\n            </p>\\n\\n            {/* Micro Feed of Dragon Awakening */}\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-2 border-t border-[#E5E4DF] pt-3.5 mb-5 text-xs font-mono\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8F8D88] font-bold block mb-1\\\">\\n                Hoard Intrusion Log (\302\2472215)\\n              </span>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-bold text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">Footprint on Stone</p>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#8F8D88]\\\">Scent of Mortal Flesh</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#FEF3C7] text-[#92400E] font-bold text-[10px]\\\">\\n                  Hoard Breached\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-bold text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">Night Patrol of Geatland</p>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#8F8D88]\\\">Vomiting Billows of Flame</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#92400E]/15 text-[#92400E] font-bold text-[10px]\\\">\\n                  Rampage Active\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-bold text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">The King\'s Hall Burned</p>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#8F8D88]\\\">Gift-Throne Consumed in Ash</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#111110] text-white font-bold text-[10px]\\\">\\n                  War Declared\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onOpenVerseModal(2215)}\\n            className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#111110] hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors cursor-pointer w-full text-left\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span>INSPECT CODEX \302\2472215</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-[#666562]\\\">arrow_forward</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Module 02: Comitatus & Thane Desertion */}\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#E5E4DF] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#111110]/30 transition-all\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#E8F5EE] text-[#0B3B24] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">group_remove</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#0B3B24] tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n                MODULE 02\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold font-sans text-[#111110] mb-1.5\\\">\\n              Comitatus Oath Breakdown\\n            </h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#666562] leading-relaxed mb-4\\\">\\n              When the heat of the barrow billowed through the stone arch, ten hand-picked Geatish warriors broke their sworn mead-bench oaths and fled into the forest.\\n            </p>\\n\\n            {/* War-Band Stack Preview */}\\n            <div className=\\\"border-t border-[#E5E4DF] pt-3.5 space-y-2.5 mb-5 text-xs font-mono\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8F8D88] font-bold\\\">\\n                  Geatish Retinue Distribution\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-bold text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">12 Men at Earnaness</span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Stacked Visual Bar */}\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full h-2.5 rounded-full flex overflow-hidden border border-[#E5E4DF]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-[#92400E] h-full\\\" style={{ width: \'83%\' }} title=\\\"10 Cowardly Thanes\\\"></div>\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-[#0B3B24] h-full\\\" style={{ width: \'9%\' }} title=\\\"Wiglaf\\\"></div>\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-[#111110] h-full\\\" style={{ width: \'8%\' }} title=\\\"King Beowulf\\\"></div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1 text-[11px]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#666562]\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#92400E] inline-block\\\"></span>\\n                    Fled into Earnaness Woods\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-[#92400E]\\\">10 Thanes</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#666562]\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0B3B24] inline-block\\\"></span>\\n                    W\304\253gl\304\201f (Waegmunding Kin)\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-[#0B3B24]\\\">1 Thane</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#666562]\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#111110] inline-block\\\"></span>\\n                    The Aged King\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-[#111110]\\\">Beowulf</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onOpenVerseModal(2633)}\\n            className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#111110] hover:text-[#0B3B24] transition-colors cursor-pointer w-full text-left\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[#0B3B24]\\\">READ WIGLAF\'S REBUKE (\302\2472633)</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-[#666562]\\\">arrow_forward</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Module 03: The Biting of Naegling */}\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#E5E4DF] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#111110]/30 transition-all\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F9F8F5] text-[#111110] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">broken_image</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#111110] tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n                MODULE 03\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold font-sans text-[#111110] mb-1.5\\\">\\n              The Shattering of N\303\246gling\\n            </h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#666562] leading-relaxed mb-4\\\">\\n              Beowulf swings his ancient grey-etched sword with such monumental ferocity that the blade snaps against the dragon\'s skull. His own mortal strength was too immense for iron.\\n            </p>\\n\\n            {/* Checklist of Combat Points */}\\n            <div className=\\\"border-t border-[#E5E4DF] pt-3.5 space-y-2 text-xs font-mono mb-5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8F8D88] font-bold block mb-1\\\">\\n                Combat Audit Verification\\n              </span>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#92400E] font-bold\\\">\342\234\227</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">N\303\246gling Longsword</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#92400E] uppercase\\\">Snapped In Two</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#0B3B24] font-bold\\\">\342\234\223</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">Wiglaf Strikes Underbelly</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#0B3B24] uppercase\\\">Flames Diminish</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#0B3B24] font-bold\\\">\342\234\223</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">Beowulf\'s Seam-Knife</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#0B3B24] uppercase\\\">Beast Slain</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-[#F9F8F5] border border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[#92400E] font-bold\\\">!</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-[#111110] text-[11px]\\\">Venomous Neck Bite</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#92400E] bg-[#FEF3C7] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">\\n                  Fatal Wound\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onOpenTestament}\\n            className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-[#E5E4DF] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#111110] hover:text-[#92400E] transition-colors cursor-pointer w-full text-left\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[#92400E]\\\">HEAR BEOWULF\'S LAST WORDS</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-[#666562]\\\">arrow_forward</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/BeowulfModules.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Beowulf modules component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Beowulf Part 3 modules section\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
