          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                \"To the Sovereign Lord of all I utter my thanks,<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                to the King of Glory, eternal Ruler, for these treasures,<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                which I could win for my people before my death.<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                Now I have traded my aged life for this hoard of gold;<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                attend now to the needs of our nation;<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                I may abide here no longer.<br /><br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                Command the battle-famed men to rear a mound,<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                shining after the pyre, at the sea\'s headland;<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                it shall tower high on Whale\'s Ness (Hronesness)<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                as a memorial to my people, so seafarers will call it<br />"
