  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Deal Comparisons**\n\nI\'m currently focused on directly comparing the *Ridge Alpine* and *Kierland Hideaway* deals. The initial numbers look promising with impressive cash-on-cash returns. I\'m digging into the financing structures, especially the DSCR aspect of the Gatlinburg cabin versus the conventional loan for the Scottsdale villa. I\'m also now weighing the significance of the HOA restrictions and comparing them directly.\n\n\n**Expanding Deal Portfolio**\n\nI\'ve added the *Gulf Shores Sandcastle* deal to my considerations, alongside *Ridge Alpine* and *Kierland Hideaway*. The Gulf Shores property is intriguing due to its seller financing and high cash-on-cash return. I\'m also now structuring a pipeline with stages: Inbox, Analyzing, LOI Sent, Under Contract, Closed, and Archived. I\'m now structuring a system for dual-mode authentication.\n\n\n**Developing Guest Demo Feature**\n\nI\'m focused on the guest demo mode, envisioning a sandbox for testing all features without signing up. I\'ve designed an automated database setup with the pre-modeled deals. I\'m testing the volatile session and local storage to make sure all features work without a required login.\n\n**Implementing Deal Ingestion**\n\nNow, I\'m working on the backend API services. I\'m building a `POST /api/deals/ingest-url` endpoint to process property URLs from sources like Zillow. I\'m using Firecrawl (or a mock scraper) to extract markdown and then Gemini 2.5 Flash to create an easy JSON schema.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 827633710
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "AX25aq6qM-3xz7IPpcnTmQ0"
  }
}
